<title>KENYA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA V SRI LANKA ONE-DAY SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA V SRI LANKA ONE-DAY SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
